.buildplan
debug*

# Local dot-entries. Do NOT re-introduce a blanket `.*` rule here: it also matched
# .github/, .dockerignore, .readthedocs.yaml and every nested .gitignore, so those files
# could never be `git add`ed — the add just succeeded silently and staged nothing.
# `.env*` (not `.env.*`): the secret files on real machines include .env_more and
# .env.bak_<stamp>, and only the first form has a dot after "env".
.env*
!.env.example
.sog_setup/
.spatopic_tool_id.txt
.worktrees/
.history/

